<title>USA: GOLF-SECOND-ROUND LEADERS AT LAS VEGAS INVITATIONAL.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SECOND-ROUND LEADERS AT LAS VEGAS INVITATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaders after the first round</p>
<p>of the $1.65 million Las Vegas Invitational golf tournament on</p>
<p>Thursday (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>126 Rick Fehr 64 62</p>
<p>129 Ronnie Black 64-65, Fred Funk 63 66</p>
<p>130 Jim Furyk 66 64</p>
<p>131 Payne Stewart 63 68, Paul Azinger 67 64, Lee Janzen</p>
<p>66-65</p>
<p>132 David Ogrin 69 63, Keith Fergus 62 70, Olin Browne 66 66</p>
<p>133 Davis Love III 66 67, Glen Day 66 67, Fred Couples 66 67,</p>
<p>Tiger Woods 70 63, Frank Lickliter 66 67.</p>
<p>134 Brian Henninger 66 68, Fuzzy Zoeller 69 65, Clarence Rose</p>
<p>68 66, Dan Pohl 68 66, David Edwards 68 66, Scott McCarron 68</p>
<p>66, Don Pooley 68 66, Patrick Burke 66 68, Bruce Lietzke 66</p>
<p>68, Vijay Singh 66 68.</p>
<p>Other international scores:</p>
<p>135 Craig Parry (Australia) 68 67</p>
<p>136 David Frost (South Africa) 65 71</p>
<p>138 Steve Rintoul (Australia) 71 67</p>
<p>139 Fulton Allem (South Africa), 73 66 140 Stuart Appleby</p>
<p>(Australia) 73 67.</p>
<p>142 Grant Waite (New Zealand) 73 69 144 Denis Watson</p>
<p>(Zimbabwe) 71 73</p>
